Use case: stylized-concept / identity-preserve.
Asset type: Arena Criolla production 2D fighting-game eight-pose atlas.
Create a NEW faithfully drawn Javier Romero / Javier Hala Madrid using the two recent real video frames. IMAGE1: identity reference of the LARGE man in the FOREGROUND ONLY, wearing a light gray athletic shirt. IGNORE every person, background and caption behind him. IMAGE2: same Javier, three-quarter face with a backwards cap, identity reference only. IMAGE3: established game atlas, rendering STYLE ONLY, NEVER copy that young clean-shaven man's identity.
The OLD Javier was a generic clean-shaven cartoon with a giant quiff; REPLACE that look. Exact CURRENT Javier likeness: medium warm tan/olive skin, mature oval face with fuller cheeks, strong expressive thick dark eyebrows with slightly raised inner ends, large brown eyes, long straight nose with a rounded tip, broad mouth and full lips, slightly prominent ears, short dense moustache with neatly edged goatee and short chin/jaw beard, narrow soul patch. Keep the beard and moustache in EVERY pose. Black naturally wavy hair, brushed upward with subtle curls and short sides, MODERATE volume, no oversized pompadour. No cap for this outfit, no glasses. Keep facial geometry from the real foreground man, not a superhero jaw.
Clothes: light gray short-sleeve textured waffle athletic crew-neck shirt exactly like IMAGE1 (subtle small texture, no logos), charcoal straight fitted trousers, plain white low-top trainers. Thin discreet chain at neckline. No microphone or props. This is a natural adult man: shoulder width, chest, forearms, torso and long legs proportioned to a SMALL adult head, about 7.5 head lengths standing height; realistic average athletic build without inflated muscles. No chibi, bobblehead or shortened limbs.
Style: match IMAGE3's fine crisp dark ink contours and deliberate cel-shaded 2D illustration with drawn facial anatomy and readable fabric folds. NOT photographic texture/collage, NOT 3D or anime. Adult illustrated proportions.
OUTPUT genuine transparent PNG landscape 2:1, 2048x1024. EXACTLY EIGHT separate complete full-body silhouettes, FOUR equal columns and TWO equal rows. At least 40px empty transparent outer margin on ALL four edges, especially below shoes. All hair, fingers, soles and kicked legs fit fully inside each cell with generous space between figures. Same man, outfit, face and scale in all cells. One connected silhouette per figure. No extra person.
All figures in shallow three-quarter view with both eyes visible, chest partially toward viewer, gaze/leading foot/attacks aimed at the opponent at screen RIGHT. Never face LEFT or show the back.
Exact pose order left-to-right then next row:
0 compact relaxed ready guard, hands at chest, gently bent knees, knowing half-smile and raised eyebrow;
1 raised two-forearm defensive block close to face, visibly different from ready;
2 run RIGHT with LEFT knee and LEFT foot leading, RIGHT leg trailing, right arm forward;
3 run RIGHT with RIGHT knee and RIGHT foot leading, LEFT leg trailing, left arm forward: genuinely OPPOSITE stride from pose2;
4 airborne tucked-knee jump, both feet raised;
5 straight punch fully extended RIGHT, other fist at chin;
6 high side kick extended RIGHT, other leg planted and supporting body;
7 hurt recoil away from a hit, face still looking RIGHT.
No detached accessories, text, captions, lettering, floor, ground shadow, particles, aura, grid, border, background or watermark. Preserve actual alpha, including gaps between arms and legs.

Use case: stylized-concept / identity-preserve.
Asset type: production eight-pose 2D fighting-game sprite atlas for Arena Criolla.
Draw Dayana Mendoza, the Venezuelan Miss Universe 2008, wearing a football/soccer Vinotinto kit requested by the game creator. IMAGE1 is her face closeup. IMAGE2 shows the same woman on the LEFT ONLY, with long dark brown hair; ignore the woman on the right. IMAGE3 is FOOTBALL CLOTHING ONLY; do not copy the male model's face, body or ball. IMAGE4 defines the hand-inked cel-shaded 2D game illustration STYLE ONLY.
Identity: a tall naturally slender adult woman, long oval face, high cheekbones, defined but soft jaw, light green/hazel eyes, dark arched eyebrows, broad warm smile and full lips. Long dark chestnut brown hair with soft waves tucked behind shoulders, like the woman on the LEFT in image2; same hairstyle and face in all poses. Natural adult proportions about seven and a half heads tall, athletic but not overmuscled. Faithfully draw her individual face, never a generic doll, anime or chibi. No crown, earrings, gown, sash, high heels or pageant props.
Wardrobe faithfully based on IMAGE3: full-length regular-fit burgundy/VINOTINTO short-sleeve soccer jersey, subtle tonal geometric tepui pattern, narrow creamy golden V-neck and cuffs, three shoulder stripes YELLOW/BLUE/RED; small shield patch on left chest. Matching burgundy football shorts of normal mid-thigh sports length with gold trim and narrow tricolor side stripe, burgundy knee-high socks, white low football cleats with subtle gold details. Keep entire shirt covering waist, no crop top. No number, sponsor lettering or added words. This outfit is an artistic sports adaptation, not a new athlete identity. No ball in sprite.
Hand-drawn 2D arcade illustration: fine crisp dark contours, careful cel-shaded face, hair and fabric folds, readable realistic anatomy exactly matching IMAGE4's finish. No photographic textures, cutout, glossy skin or 3D render.
OUTPUT landscape transparent PNG 2:1, 2048x1024. EXACTLY EIGHT complete separate full-body figures arranged FOUR equal columns by TWO rows. One connected silhouette per figure. Generous transparent gaps; minimum40px transparent margin at every outside edge especially under shoes. Every hair, finger, cleat, limb and kick complete inside its cell, consistent identity/outfit/head size/body scale across eight poses.
All face opponent on screen RIGHT in shallow three-quarter view, both eyes visible; chest partially toward viewer, leading foot/attacks/gaze to RIGHT. Never back view or facing left.
Exact order:
0 confident balanced ready guard, hands chest height, soft staggered athletic stance and warm determined smile;
1 raised two-arm blocking guard near face;
2 run RIGHT with LEFT knee and foot ahead, right leg trailing, right arm forward;
3 genuinely OPPOSITE run stride: RIGHT foot ahead, left leg trailing, left arm forward;
4 tucked-knee airborne jump, both cleats lifted;
5 long straight punch RIGHT with other fist guarding;
6 high side kick extending RIGHT with supporting foot planted;
7 hurt recoil leaning back while looking RIGHT.
Real transparent alpha everywhere except connected figures including between arms and legs. No separate props, extra people, field, floor, shadow, grid, borders, labels, lettering, particles, effects or watermark.
